{title: O Rangrezwa}
{artist: Sonu Nigam}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm]Han jache nahi yeh kora kora,        [Gm]mann O rangrez [A#]wa
[Cm]Haan rom rom prem rang rang,        [Gm]de O rangrez [A#]wa
[D#]Roop tu tera naino me [G#]chhap [A#]de,        [D#]Han dil ki koonchi se
rooh ki [G#]dawat [A#]se,        [Fm]Sanwar de [Gm]sawariya [G#]sans sans [A#]tu
[Fm]Ye jan rang [Gm]de jahan rang [G#]de,        Ishq wala [A#]pagla paran rang de
Interlude,        [Cm] ... [Gm] .. [G#] .. [A#] ..x2
[Cm]A mujhe zara rubabi rang,        [Gm]de O rangrez [A#]wa
[Cm]Han harf harf tu kitabi rang,        [Gm]de O rangrez [A#]wa
[D#]Boond boond tu mujhme [G#]utar [A#]de,        [D#]Han pyar me lagun itna tu [G#]pyar [A#]de
[G#]Chahat rang [A#]chadha de [Fm]sathiya,        [G#]Aafat rang [Fm]badha de [A#]jogiya
[Fm]Sanwar de [Gm]sawariya [G#]sans sans [A#]tu,        [Fm]Ye jan rang [Gm]de jahan rang [G#]de
Ishq wala [A#]pagla paran rang de
